    'welcome/5': 'Naming the habit helps you notice when you are doing the work instead of managing it.',
    'welcome/6': 'People stay for a manager who notices them. These four habits are how you keep your best people.',
    'welcome/7': 'What you say next decides whether she trusts you with the next hard thing, and whether her leave is handled correctly.',
